   *  it sounds here: a page docking an app-owned studio session must not be torn off until
   *  `studioDetached` can recognise its section, because two windows mounting one studio put two xterms
   *  on a single PTY and they fight over `pty_resize`. `TabBar` has always taken this optionally; only
   *  this wrapper insisted. */
